gearcoleco (1.6.8-1~ppa1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.6.8.
  * Build against libsdl3-dev 3.4.10+ds-1.
  * Improve the embedded MCP server, including protocol validation,
    tool discovery and annotations, routing, and HTTP transport reliability.
  * Add run-ahead support for reduced input latency.
  * Add Variable Refresh Rate support.
  * Add additional disassembler syntaxes.
  * Add configurable screen-saver behavior.
  * Associate ColecoVision ROM files with the desktop application.
  * Include assorted emulation, debugger, user-interface, and stability fixes.

